  "description": {
   "en": "Yuuta is your typical gloomy guy.\n\nOne day, he gets invited to an IRL meeting by someone he met online with a shared interest. He wondered what kind of person would be there, and it turned out to be a beautiful lady far beyond his expectation! Yuuta felt thrilled but guilty, and he was flustered at every turn. Seeing him like that, she utters a certain question……?\n\n**Note:** These are pilot chapters used by the publisher to gauge interest for the story and see if it's worth serializing."
  },
